DOC|decisions_log|v1|updated=2026-03-14a|latest=D056
META|purpose=settled decisions + WHY — prevents re-litigating; load before self-edit
META|format=D{n}|topic|status|why (one line per decision; drill to decisions_log.csb.txt for full rationale)
META|status_values=implemented,planned,implemented-poc,implemented-seeds,defined

// ── Foundational ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

D001|everything-is-memory|implemented|unified model: no special cases; habits=PROC memories; values=high-inertia memories; everything connected+evolvable
D002|brain-region-naming|implemented|neuroscience names are functionally accurate not metaphorical; each module does what the biological region does
D003|api-first-reasoning|implemented|start with API quality; habituation replaces LLM calls over time; don't prematurely optimize away capability
D004|sqlite-not-json|implemented|SQLite survives crashes; atomic writes; queryable; JSON files corrupt silently and can't be queried
D005|inertia-from-network-position|implemented|inertia computed from graph position+activation+dependencies; not manually assigned; emerges from use
D006|csb-format|implemented|pipe-delimited key:value; human+machine readable without parser overhead; no quoting needed
D007|push-based-twm|implemented|TWM is push-only (sources deposit); NE/reasoner pull; decouples producers from consumers; TTL cleans up
D008|svelte-starlette-web-ui|implemented|Starlette daemon thread; Svelte frontend; keeps Igor single-process; web is output channel not control plane
D009|daemon-threads-for-background|implemented|NE+listener+web as daemon threads; die with main process; no orphan processes on crash
D010|ring-memory-for-context|implemented|FIFO-50 in SQLite; survives restarts; injected into every API call; gives session continuity cheaply

// ── Architecture ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

D011|base34-instance-ids|defined|7-char base-34 epoch seconds; unique+sortable+encodes age; no registry needed
D012|haiku-for-self-edits|implemented|self-edit+debug always use Haiku regardless of IGOR_MODEL; frequent code ops need cost reduction not quality
D013|single-embedding-model|implemented|nomic-embed-text on all cluster machines; one model = consistent vector space; cosine similarity meaningful across instances
D014|ring-injection-ownership|implemented|main.py owns ring injection (not reasoners); prevents double-injection; single choke point
D015|gateway-pattern|implemented|DAG routing in inference_gateway.py; routing policy in one file not scattered across 5; visibility via describe()
D016|arbiter-queue|implemented|file-backed JSON queue for irreversible actions; human approves before Igor acts; currently disabled (IGOR_ARBITER_ENABLED=false)
D017|hybrid-embedding-search|implemented|text keyword scan→embedding rerank; Phase1 always works; Phase2 improves ranking when Ollama up; graceful degradation
D018|reasoning-cache|implemented|TTL 12min + TWM watermark invalidation; watermark correct semantic signal — new observations→reasoning may differ
D019|priority-sorted-pool|implemented|machines sorted realtime→main_loop→background→batch; better latency without query classification

// ── Session / Context ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

D020|portable-identity|implemented|SOUL.md+IDENTITY.md written every boot from DB; never drift from DB state; SOUL.md shared, IDENTITY.md instance-scoped
D021|token-economy|implemented|tool results capped 20K chars; 25 tool-call turns max; truncation notice addresses model ("break large tasks")
D022|warm-context|implemented|serialize TWM+ring_tail+ne_state at shutdown; reload at boot; TTL=4h; rotation .0→.1 prevents corrupt-on-^C
D023|adaptive-routing|implemented|boot benchmark measured not guessed; latency budget as hard raise not soft preference; weights reset each boot (habit compiler persists patterns)
D024|self-instrumentation|implemented|observe() = Igor debugging himself; forensic logs = us debugging Igor; EXPERIENTIAL memories low-noise
D025|koboldcpp|implemented|per-request context_size is primary advantage; llama.cpp exposes eval metadata; Ollama retained as fallback
D026|reasoner-hierarchy|implemented|two-level: transport base classes (stable structural diffs) + ModelFamily failover; ClaudeFamily = single handle for "ask Claude"

// ── TWM / Memory ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

D027|twm-ttl-extension|implemented|TTL extends on confirmed usefulness not mere access; 3 signals: NE promotes(A), positive response valence(B), high cosine relevance(C)
D028|twm-urgency|implemented|urgency⊥salience; urgency*salience sorts NE queue; idempotent migration; urgency≥0.7 flagged distinctly in context
D029|habit-compiler|implemented-seeds|PROC_HABIT_COMPILER+4 primitives in genesis; valence=0.8 (meta-capability); compiler finds its own description in LTM when implemented
D030|tool-habit-migration|implemented-poc|code_ref in PROC metadata links habit description to Python impl; provenance=builtin enables future trust tiers
D031|routing-groundwork|implemented|PROC_ROUTING_* in genesis; EPISODIC audit trail; when EPISODICs cluster→habit compiler replaces hardcoded Python

// ── Inference Tier ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

D032|cloud-cheap-interactive|planned|local 1B too slow for conversational UX (no GPU); gpt-4o-mini ~$0.001/turn; local retained for NE/preparse/batch only
D033|csb-preparse|implemented|[PARSED_INPUT] CSB block forwarded to cloud reasoners; LLM preparse toggleable without changing routing logic; max_tokens=120 timeout=8s
D034|speed-optimizations|implemented|fast-path skips LLM for greetings/commands (<1ms); parallel preparse+search via ThreadPoolExecutor; HTTP keep-alive for KoboldCpp
D035|interactive-persona-tier|implemented|tier.3.5 between cheap+claude; t3=mechanical (no identity needed), t35=conversational (persona must be embodied), t4=complex+tools
D036|milieu|implemented|3D affect (valence/arousal/dominance); asymmetric EMA (fast rise α=0.25, slow fall α=0.05); JSON persists across restarts; dominance baseline=+0.3
D037|basal-ganglia|implemented|parallel scoring replaces first-match-wins; milieu modulates threshold [0.30,0.70]; lateral inhibition; score= in ring entries = audit trail
D038|training-corpus|implemented|staged ~/.TheIgors/training_corpus/; fetch→train→evict; cursor in index.json for resumability; corpus IDs don't pollute habit scoring

// ── Session 2026-03-13 additions ──────────────────────────────────────────────

D039|db-proxy|implemented|DatabaseProxy wraps all SQLite calls; timing+metrics ring; reconnect on failure; callers never know connection dropped; foundation for sync (#190)
D040|hot-module-reload|implemented|importlib.reload() on stateless leaf modules; HIGH inertia blocked; tool modules self-re-register; no restart needed for leaf patches
D041|stateless-by-design|implemented|hot-reloadable modules hold no state (state in DB); __class__ swap for edge cases; cortex=only stateful owner (owns DB proxy)
D042|dsb-format|implemented|Distilled Structured Block; replaces CSB for machine-facing docs; ~80% token reduction; DSB loads directly into system prompt CHARACTER layer

// ── Session 2026-03-13g additions ─────────────────────────────────────────────

D053|ne-response-format-json|implemented|NE OR calls include response_format:json_object; _h_or wires it from purpose.extra; eliminates prose-wrapping parse failures

// ── Session 2026-03-14a additions ─────────────────────────────────────────────

D054|browser-use-for-ai-consultation|planned|anonymous browser_use to free AI web UIs (no API key); TopicExpander calls Gemini/ChatGPT web for reading lists; no credential provisioning
D055|igor-chrome-identity|planned|Chrome profile as theigorsigor@gmail.com; one login unlocks Gmail/Gemini/Calendar/Drive/Contacts; Igor creates own accounts on new services; supersedes #186 OAuth approach
D056|curriculum-language-first|defined|learning order: language→cogsci→how-Igor-works→programming/AI→culture; language first because word graph IS a language model; how-Igor-works before external AI framing

// ── Session 2026-03-13f additions ─────────────────────────────────────────────

D052|book-learner-console-notes|implemented|new/resume note on absorption start in book_learner.py + open_book(); book_learner stdout routed to ~/.TheIgors/logs/book_learner.log (was DEVNULL)

// ── Session 2026-03-13e additions ─────────────────────────────────────────────

D049|reading-list-db-table|implemented|reading_list table in main DB; fields: title/author/source/book_type/reading_rate/priority/status/emotional_significance/encoding_arousal/added_by; 15 books seeded
D050|slow-fast-reading|defined|slow/fast reading = same extraction pipeline; difference is emotional milieu state during read; all books get fast matrix pass; important books also get slow pass later
D051|fiction-filter-author-blocklist|implemented|_FICTION_AUTHORS set in learner.py; checked before tags; tag-based filter catches tagged fiction; author list catches untagged; explicit requests bypass filter entirely

// ── Session 2026-03-13c additions ─────────────────────────────────────────────

D043|db-proxy-commit|implemented|_DBContext.__exit__ must commit() before close(); rollback() on exception; matches `with conn:` semantics; silent rollback was corrupting all writes
D044|habit-action-list|implemented|habits support actions[] (list) in metadata → random choice; single action field still works; enables response variety without code branches
D045|temporal-context-injection|implemented|ring entries show YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM when not today; memories show "stored Xd ago (date)"; LLM can now distinguish past from present
D046|book-learner|implemented|claudecode/book_learner.py; chunks ebook via ebook_reader; extracts FACTUAL/INTERPRETIVE/PROCEDURAL nodes via LLM; deposits via cortex; checkpoint/resume; trains word graph per chunk
D047|learn-about-tool|implemented|tools/learner.py; go-learn-about habit; Calibre non-fiction filter; browser AI discovery; tonight→queue; all background runs use local Ollama (free); night queue drains at human pace
D048|book-learner-local|implemented|--local flag uses Ollama /api/chat directly; --url flag for web sources; cache_control:ephemeral on system prompt for Claude models via OR
